ationLabel}}</view></view><text class="cabin-affection-float cabin-affection-float-three">♥</text></view><view id="roomContainer" class="u9 u7 u335 u78 u99 u100 u336 u49 u118 u337 {{lampOn ? 'cabin-lamp-on' : 'cabin-lamp-off'}} {{daytime ? 'cabin-room-day' : 'cabin-room-night'}}" style=";height:calc(548 * var(--layout-unit));"><image id="cabinBgImage" src="{{daytime ? '/assets/photos/cabin-day.jpg' : '/assets/photos/cabin-night.jpg'}}" class="u7 u101 u102 u337 u249 u338 u339 u340" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="true" binderror="onImageError" style="position:absolute;inset:0;filter:{{daytime ? 'brightness(1.06) saturate(1.04)' : (lampOn ? 'brightness(0.82) saturate(0.90)' : 'brightness(0.60) saturate(0.80)')}};transition:none;"/><view id="dayOverlay" class="cabin-day-light" style="opacity:{{daytime ? 0.28 : 0}}"/><view id="nightOverlay" class="cabin-night-light" style="opacity:{{daytime ? 0 : (lampOn ? 0.14 : 0.28)}}"/><view id="lampGlow" class="cabin-lamp-glow" style="opacity:{{lampOn ? (daytime ? 0.12 : 1) : 0}}"/><view id="lampShadow" class="cabin-lamp-shadow" style="opacity:{{daytime || lampOn ? 0 : 0.35}}"/><button id="hotspotLamp" bindtap="onAction" data-action="lamp" class="u72 u356 u357 u358 u359 u5 u10 u18 u360" hover-class="native-pressed" aria-label="{{lampOn ? '关闭台灯' : '打开台灯'}}"><view class="u5 u18 u329 u107 u67 u31 u286 u25 u49 u361 u246 u56 u57 u26 u362 u36 u37"><image src="/assets/icons/lightbulb-553c628d.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/><text id="lampStateText" class="">{{lampOn ? '台灯开' : '台灯关'}}</text></view></button><button id="hotspotPhotos" bindtap="onAction" data-action="photos" class="u72 u364 u365 u358 u359 u5 u10 u18 u360" hover-class="native-pressed" aria-label="photos"><view class="u5 u18 u329 u107 u67 u31 u286 u25 u49 u366 u51 u56 u57 u26 u362 u36 u37"><image src="/assets/icons/photo_camera-45c744cf.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="">照片墙</text></view></button><button id="hotspotEnvelope" bindtap="onAction" data-action="route" data-value="mailbox" class="u72 u367 u368 u358 u359 u5 u10 u18 u360" hover-class="native-pressed" aria-label="route"><view class="u5 u18 u329 u107 u67 u31 u369 u25 u49 u370 u246 u56 u57 u26 u362 u36 u37"><image src="/assets/icons/mark_email_unread-49ea0323.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="">时光胶囊信件</text></view></button><button id="hotspotCouple" bindtap="onAction" data-action="route" data-value="mood" class="u72 u371 u372 u373 u358 u359 u5 u10 u18 u360" hover-class="native-pressed" aria-label="route"><view class="u5 u18 u329 u46 u47 u31 u374 u25 u49 u375 u280 u56 u57 u281 u362 u36 u37"><image src="/assets/icons/favorite-876e38f1.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="">心有灵犀</text></view></button></view>  <view class="u85 u86 u201 u88 u49 u118 u5 u10 u385"> <view class="u5 u18 u19 u386 u387 u388 native-between"> <view class="u5 u18 u328"> <image src="/assets/icons/diversity_1-37d59738.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(34.615 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(34.615 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/> <text class="u160 u161 u1">今天的我们 · 情绪双向连结</text> </view> <text class="u56 u57 u93">{{cloudMode ? "共同空间" : "本机模式"}}</text> </view> <view class="u81 u82 u389 native-pair-grid">  <view class="u140 u266 u87 u5 u10 u19 u390 u49 u391"> <view class="u5 u18 u19 native-between"> <view class="u5 u18 u328"> <view class="u137 u138 u31 u392 u5 u18 u6 u32 u56 u57 u221">我</view> <text class="u91 u92 u1">{{mine || '我'}}</text> </view>  </view> <view class="cabin-mood-line" bindtap="onAction" data-action="route" data-value="mood"><text wx:if="{{moodEmoji}}" class="cabin-mood-emoji">{{moodEmoji}}</text><view class="cabin-mood-copy"><view class="cabin-mood-status">{{mood || "还没有记录心情"}}</view><view wx:if="{{moodNote}}" class="cabin-mood-note">{{moodNote}}</view></view><text class="cabin-mood-arrow">›</text></view> <view class="u5 u18 u19 u114 native-between"> <view class="u56 u57 u93 u5 u18"> <image src="/assets/icons/battery_charging_full-aa6ce1fc.png" class="native-icon u39 u394" style="width:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/>未读取电量</view>  </view> </view>  <view class="u395 u266 u87 u5 u10 u19 u390 u49 u396"> <view class="u5 u18 u19 native-between"> <view class="u5 u18 u328"> <view class="u137 u138 u31 u279 u5 u18 u6 u284 u56 u57 u221">TA</view> <text class="u91 u92 u1">{{partner || 'TA'}}</text> </view>  </view> <view class="cabin-mood-line cabin-mood-partner"><text wx:if="{{partnerMoodEmoji}}" class="cabin-mood-emoji">{{partnerMoodEmoji}}</text><view class="cabin-mood-copy"><view class="cabin-mood-status">{{partnerMoodKind || partnerMood}}</view><view wx:if="{{partnerMoodKind && partnerMood !== partnerMoodKind}}" class="cabin-mood-note">{{partnerMood}}</view></view></view> <view class="u5 u18 u19 u114 native-between"> <view class="u56 u57 u93 u5 u18"> <image src="/assets/icons/auto_awesome-fb96fb2c.png" class="native-icon u39 u394" style="width:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(25 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/>未读取电量</view>  </view> </view> </view> </view>    <view class="u412 u86 u201 u49 u413 u414 u9 u99"><view class="u72 u415 u416 u137 u417 u418 u419 u315"/><view class="u5 u18 u19 u420 u421 u387 u422 native-between"><view class="u5 u18 u328"><image src="/assets/icons/sticky_note_2-c05d4a0b.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(34.615 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(34.615 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="u160 u161 u246 u43">小屋便签 · 时光胶囊</text></view><button bindtap="onAction" data-action="note" class="u423 u107 u56 u57 u32 u424 u5 u18 u425 u36 u426" hover-class="native-pressed" aria-label="note"><image src="/assets/icons/edit-3d63afcd.png" class="native-icon u39" style="width:calc(30.769 * var(--layout-unit));height:calc(30.769 * var(--layout-unit));" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="">写便签</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{notes.length}}" class="note-filters"><button class="note-chip {{noteFilter === '全部' ? 'note-chip-active' : ''}}" bindtap="onAction" data-action="filterNotes" data-value="全部">全部便签</button><button wx:for="{{noteCategories}}" wx:key="*this" class="note-chip {{noteFilter === item ? 'note-chip-active' : ''}}" bindtap="onAction" data-action="filterNotes" data-value="{{item}}">{{item}}</button></view><button wx:if="{{noteFilter !== '全部' && noteFilter !== '未分类'}}" class="qa-link" bindtap="onAction" data-action="deleteNoteCategory" data-value="{{noteFilter}}">删除当前分类</button><view wx:if="{{!visibleNotes.length}}" class="qa-caption">还没有便签，写下想对TA说的话吧。</view><view wx:for="{{visibleNotes}}" wx:key="id" class="u427 note-row"><view class="note-row-top"><text class="note-category">{{item.category}}</text><view><button class="qa-link note-action" bindtap="onAction" data-action="editNote" data-value="{{item.id}}">编辑</button><button class="qa-link note-action" bindtap="onAction" data-action="deleteNote" data-value="{{item.id}}">删除</button></view></view><view class="u70 u71 u1 u113 u429 note-content">{{item.content}}</view></view></view>  <button class="cabin-meeting-card" bindtap="onAction" data-action="route" data-value="reunion" hover-class="settings-item-pressed" aria-label="设置下次见面日期"><view class="cabin-meeting-heading"><view class="cabin-meeting-icon"><image class="" src="/assets/icons/flight_takeoff-474d0a7d.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><text>下一次，见到你</text><text class="cabin-meeting-arrow">›</text></view><view class="cabin-meeting-body"><view class="cabin-meeting-copy"><view class="cabin-meeting-title">下次见面倒计时</view><view class="cabin-meeting-date">{{meetingDate ? meetingDate + ' · ' + meetingLabel : '把期待，留给一个确定的日子'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{meetingDate}}" class="cabin-meeting-count"><text>{{meetingDays}}</text><text class="cabin-meeting-unit">天</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!meetingDate}}" class="cabin-meeting-cta">去设置见面日期 <text>→</text></view></button> </view>    <include src="/shared/feature-editor.wxml"/></view>
